<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Omnicom started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Omnicom started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Friday it started coverage on the shares of Omnicom Group Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 1/4 to 69-3/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
